ools (it returns only a note), which the gate test now lists. Device test T60. **Decided without you:** the plan never says what the guide tool is, so I took it to mean this pointer from the Checkout tab, kept to the main screen (windows are drawn above it). Not tried: the overlay on a real iPad. Not in this patch: the screen and register context tool (so no starting from the current screen), the date and time tool | your request |
